    "description": "What: On demo-city, with SUMO background traffic (600 cars, seed 1), four APCs ('Escort 1'..'Escort 4') drive east as a road convoy (ConvoyOrder, Mode Traffic: the lead handed to SUMO) along the single-lane road e_axis_w_zip_d_0_3 (driving lane at y 148.4) from x −1180 toward (−700, 148.4). A 'Broken truck' (our vehicle, no brain — told to SUMO as an obstacle) stands on the lane at x −900; at t 60 it is cleared (moved off the road). One lane: nothing can pass it. Judge: (1) the lead runs PlatformConvoy and is handed to SUMO; (2) it stops behind the breakdown and never passes it before it is cleared; (3) the column waits as one — never split; (4) once it is cleared the column moves on (the tail past x −880); (5) the lead arrives. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh cv-blocked-road"
